OL,5,G0005 First Dates
OL,6,     FWill a gaming nerd finally find
OL,7,     Fher 'geeky James Bond'? Can an
OL,8,     Factor overcome their First Dates
OL,9,     Fstage nerves? And will an ex-wild
OL,10,     Fthing's tattoos wreck his chances
OL,11,     Fof new love?
OL,12,G0110 Below Deck
OL,13,     FInfighting is rife among the crew.
OL,14,     FCaptain Kerry's hopeful that two
OL,15,     Fdays of rest and relaxation at a
OL,16,     Flavish villa will set things
OL,17,     Fstraight. Fat chance...
