OL,5,G0210 Below Deck
OL,6,     FAfter a rocky stay at the villa
OL,7,     Fwhere precisely no problems were
OL,8,     Fsolved, the crew head back to the
OL,9,     FSt David for their most turbulent
OL,10,     Fcharter to date.
OL,11,G0300 Below Deck
OL,12,     FThe crew pick up the pieces after
OL,13,     FHurricane Kelly - and boy are
OL,14,     Fthere a lot of pieces to pick up.
OL,15,     FAnd Jess faces the consequences of
OL,16,     Fher actions at the villa.
